.DS_Store

# Native projects are GENERATED from app.json by `expo prebuild`, not edited by
# hand — that is what keeps app.json the single source of truth for the icon,
# splash, permissions and version. Regenerate with `npm run prebuild` (or let
# EAS Build do it in the cloud). Anything hand-edited under android/ or ios/
# would be silently thrown away on the next prebuild.
android/
ios/

